<title>USA: Middlesex Township, Pa., agency deal postponed.</title>
<headline>Middlesex Township, Pa., agency deal postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said Thursday it has postponed Middlesex Township Municipal Authority, Pa., $9.3 million bond deal due to market conditions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
